<title>SWITZERLAND: Waigel says he can live with current dollar rates.</title>
<headline>Waigel says he can live with current dollar rates.</headline>
<dateline>DAVOS, Switzerland 1997-02-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>German Finance Minister Theo Waigel said on Saturday the current exchange rate level of the dollar was in line with fundamentals.</p>
<p>&quot;I think that we can live with the level that has been established by financial markets,&quot; Waigel told reporters at the World Economic Forum in Davos when asked about the current dollar standing.</p>
</text>
